    "name": "Dungeons of Edera 2",
    "steam_appid": 2373130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373130/extras/131663c0b00d7759f5da937f27dcc91d.avif?t=1751925233\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons of Edera 2 is an action RPG in which you must wage brutal guerrilla warfare on an overwhelming enemy. Take advantage of powerful abilities, classes, and tactics. As a sword-for-hire, explore immersive environments, compete for contracts across a range of factions, and tip the tide of war in your favor. You must scour the lands of Edera for supplies and legendary loot, and become a mercenary of legend - alone or with friends. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Return to Edera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land teeters on the brink of catastrophe. Old enemies return from the shadows to terrorize the lands and keep your allies separated and hopeless. Take charge of a band of mercenaries and stake your claim on the conflict.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ply Your Violent Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and customize your character from a pool of rag-tag fighters, wizards and rogues, each with their own skills, equipment, and abilities to overcome your enemies. Level up and explore each talent tree to make each class your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Your Fortune</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer treacherous dungeons, defeat formidable bosses, and claim legendary loot. Craft rare weapons and armor to bolster your arsenal. Win favor from the various factions to unlock exclusive classes, abilities, and rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unending Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the pinnacle of power and face off against formidable foes in endless challenge modes that will test your grit and reward you handsomely, if you can survive.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2373130/extras/131663c0b00d7759f5da937f27dcc91d.avif?t=1751925233\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons of Edera 2 is an action RPG in which you must wage brutal guerrilla warfare on an overwhelming enemy. Take advantage of powerful abilities, classes, and tactics. As a sword-for-hire, explore immersive environments, compete for contracts across a range of factions, and tip the tide of war in your favor. You must scour the lands of Edera for supplies and legendary loot, and become a mercenary of legend - alone or with friends. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Return to Edera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land teeters on the brink of catastrophe. Old enemies return from the shadows to terrorize the lands and keep your allies separated and hopeless. Take charge of a band of mercenaries and stake your claim on the conflict.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ply Your Violent Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and customize your character from a pool of rag-tag fighters, wizards and rogues, each with their own skills, equipment, and abilities to overcome your enemies. Level up and explore each talent tree to make each class your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Your Fortune</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer treacherous dungeons, defeat formidable bosses, and claim legendary loot. Craft rare weapons and armor to bolster your arsenal. Win favor from the various factions to unlock exclusive classes, abilities, and rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unending Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the pinnacle of power and face off against formidable foes in endless challenge modes that will test your grit and reward you handsomely, if you can survive.</p>",
    "short_description": "Return to the land of Edera, where you play as a sword-for-hire, exploring environments, competing for contracts, and waging guerrilla warfare to become a legendary mercenary, alone or with friends.",
